assets/mustang-cold-start.webp is the cold-start clip from the PITO MD blog post
"Why I built my own engine" (https://pitomd.com/blog/why-i-built-my-own-engine/),
mustang-cold-start.mp4 (sha256 ad33d3d10529a2f65c9bedfd74442d75f0ce4cc10e3e16e3ca5755810c2b851b),
rendered in pfx and made an animated WebP with pcod (pito-codecs) at 720x1280, 15 fps.
The render and the film are © 2026 Cătălin Ilinca. The PITO MD and pfx names and
logos are © 2026 Cătălin Ilinca, all rights reserved.

